# 📚 Binary Search (Part 5) - Binary Search on Answers

## 📌 Introduction

Not every Binary Search problem involves finding an element in an array. Some problems require finding the **minimum** or **maximum possible answer** that satisfies a condition.

This technique is called **Binary Search on Answers**.

Instead of searching an array, we search within a range of possible answers.

