# 1️⃣ What is Binary Search on Answers?

## 📖 Definition

Binary Search on Answers is used when the answer lies within a range of values and can be validated using a condition.

Instead of searching an array,

we search the answer space.

---

### Example

```text
Minimum Speed

Maximum Distance

Minimum Time

Maximum Capacity

Minimum Cost
```

---

### General Algorithm

```
low = minimum possible answer

high = maximum possible answer

while(low <= high)

    mid = low + (high-low)/2

    if(mid is a valid answer)

        store answer

        move left

    else

        move right
```

