# 2️⃣ Square Root of a Number

## 📖 Problem

Find the integer square root of a number.

---

### Example

```text
Input

36

Output

6
```

---

### Example

```text
Input

28

Output

5
```

Because

```
5² = 25

6² = 36
```

---

### Approach

Binary Search between

```
1

to

N
```

---

### Time Complexity

```
O(log N)
```

---

# 3️⃣ Nth Root of a Number

## 📖 Problem

Find the integer Nth root of a number.

---

### Example

```text
N = 3

M = 27
```

Output

```
3
```

Because

```
3³ = 27
```

---

### Approach

Binary Search over possible roots.

---

### Time Complexity

```
O(log M)
```

---

# 4️⃣ Koko Eating Bananas

## 📖 Problem

Find the minimum eating speed so that Koko finishes all bananas within H hours.

---

### Example

```text
Piles

3 6 7 11

Hours

8
```

Output

```
4
```

---

### Observation

Higher eating speed

↓

Less time required

The condition is monotonic.

Perfect for Binary Search.

---

### Time Complexity

```
O(N log M)
```

where

```
M = Maximum pile
```

---

# 5️⃣ Minimum Days to Make Bouquets

## 📖 Problem

Flowers bloom on different days.

Find the minimum day required to make M bouquets.

---

### Example

```text
Bloom Days

1 10 3 10 2

Bouquets

3

Flowers per Bouquet

1
```

Output

```
3
```

---

### Observation

As the number of days increases,

more flowers bloom.

The answer is monotonic.

---

### Time Complexity

```
O(N log M)
```

